  message: "P2 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 24d0b860ee; owner-requested re-check of the 51 open P2 violated/todo_hard/todo_soft items; fixtures and outputs under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p2_review_11012026/A1/). VERDICT: CURRENT, narrower than written. Fixture a.js: Conn.hello `this.write('hi')` emits only module_attr_ref -> net.Socket, no calls edge, no stub; `this.missing()` emits nothing; `this.ping()` with an in-repo Base.ping emits `calls Child.run -> external:ping {enclosing_class: Child}`. So the drop is specific to a this.m() whose name no in-repo method shares: Case 1 (js_ts.py ~6663) emits no stub on a miss, and the untyped-method placeholder arm (~7015) is gated `not is_this_call` (bf8e138dac, before filing). TypeScript identical. Title re-scoped. ROOT-CAUSE GROUP: receiver type not carried to the emission site (with WI-fihun, WI-mofil, WI-rupah, WI-vogip, INV-hovoj). Status unchanged."  # 54f9
